From u4f80e1927b0757cb at groups.google.com  Fri Apr 29 16:12:06 2022
From: u4f80e1927b0757cb at groups.google.com (Ken Kellner)
Date: Fri, 29 Apr 2022 16:12:06 +0000
Subject: Re: "occuMulti" doubts about occupancy results
Message-ID: <TUGWoYUyKbA._94EeglhAAAJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <TUGWoYUyKbA.Fh3znZVdAAAJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
References: <TUGWoYUyKbA.y-KXQhdQAAAJ@unmarked.groups.google.com> <TUGWoYUyKbA.Fh3znZVdAAAJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
